            <p className="art:mt-4 art:max-w-md art:text-sm art:leading-6 art:text-muted-foreground">A place for the early thoughts, useful references, and small decisions that move the work forward.</p>
            <div className="art:mt-9 art:divide-y art:divide-border art:rounded-2xl art:border art:border-border art:bg-background art:px-5">
              <div className="art:flex art:gap-4 art:py-5"><span className="art:pt-0.5 art:font-mono art:text-xs art:text-muted-foreground">01</span><div><p className="art:text-sm art:font-medium">Find the starting point</p><p className="art:mt-1 art:text-xs art:leading-5 art:text-muted-foreground">Bring the notes and references together.</p></div></div>
